        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Repeat daily quests across resets to reach Exalted and save the required commendations.\n\n1. Use the Tol Barad portal beside your capital's Cataclysm portals. It takes you to your faction's base on Tol Barad Peninsula. Alliance uses Baradin Base Camp around 72.5,62.6; Horde uses Hellscream's Grasp around 54.5,80.7.\n\n2. Complete the available daily quests from the base, turn them in and retain the Tol Barad Commendations. These quests are available even when the opposite faction controls the battle island. Repeat after daily resets until the relevant faction reputation reaches Exalted.\n\n3. For additional daily quests, cross the bridge to the separate Tol Barad battle island when your faction controls it. Take the quests from the outdoor hub around 51.4,49.6 and complete their marked objectives. This is the courtyard quest hub, not the raid entrance.\n\n4. If your faction does not control the island, the peninsula dailies still work. You can also participate in the next Tol Barad battle for victory rewards and access to the extra quests. Do not rely on the old comments' exact daily token totals: offered quests and controlling-faction access determine your actual earnings.\n\n5. Once you are Exalted and have 200 commendations, return to Quartermaster Brazie or Pogg at the peninsula base and buy Drake of the West Wind. Use the reins from your bags. The two factions sell the same West Wind drake; you do not need to buy it twice.",
