        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - The route is short and repeatable, but the drop is random and may take many clears.\n\n1. Travel to southeastern Uldum and fly up to The Vortex Pinnacle entrance on the floating platform at 76.8,84.4. Set Dungeon Difficulty to Normal before entering the original dungeon.\n\n2. Follow the platform path, kill Grand Vizier Ertan and use the slipstream to the next section. Clear anything keeping you in combat and continue along the wind platforms to Altairus, the second boss.\n\n3. Defeat Altairus and loot his corpse. Reins of the Drake of the North Wind can drop on Normal as well as Heroic; there is no need to kill Asaad just for this mount.\n\n4. After looting, jump off the platform. The dungeon's rescue wind returns you to its entrance. Walk out, right-click your portrait, choose Reset All Instances and enter again on Normal.\n\n5. Repeat until the reins drop or the rolling instance-entry limit stops further entries. Wait for that limit to clear, then resume. If doing a Heroic attempt instead, do not expect resetting it to restore that character's daily boss loot.",
