                label = "The Stonecore - entrance on the temple wall",
                mapName = "Deepholm",
            },
            { mapID = 324, x = 0.37, y = 0.447, step = 3, label = "Slabhide - second boss", mapName = "The Stonecore" },
        },
        itemId = 63043,
        name = "Vitreous Stone Drake",
        mountCategory = "Dungeon and Raids",
        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - A short repeatable dungeon route, with an unpredictable number of attempts.\n\n1. Reach Deepholm and fly to The Stonecore entrance on the Temple of Earth's outer wall at 47.5,52.1. Set Dungeon Difficulty to Normal before entering for repeatable mount attempts.\n\n2. Clear the opening packs and damage Millhouse Manastorm until he retreats. Follow and repeat at his next positions until Corborus bursts through and opens the way. Do not attack the last pack while Corborus is sweeping it away, as the comments report this can leave you stuck in combat.\n\n3. Kill Corborus if it or nearby enemies keep you in combat, then follow the tunnel through the rockfall area. Wait for Slabhide to land in the next cavern, defeat him and loot his corpse for the reins.\n\n4. When out of combat, use the teleporter just beyond Slabhide to return to the entrance. Walk outside, choose Reset All Instances from your portrait and repeat on Normal. You can stop after Slabhide; the final two bosses are unnecessary for the mount.\n\n5. Observe the rolling instance-entry limit. Heroic is also eligible for the mount but its boss loot resets daily, so Normal is the practical choice for consecutive runs. Use the reins when they finally drop.",
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/item=63043",
    },
