        stepCount = 4,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Quest to unlock the tabard, then earn Exalted reputation and buy the camel.\n\n1. Travel to Ramkahen in Uldum. If the zone is in the N'Zoth assault phase, use Zidormi near 56.0,35.1 to enter the earlier Uldum. Follow the original Uldum introduction and Ramkahen quests until you can buy the faction tabard at Friendly.\n\n2. Find Blacksmith Abasi at 54.0,33.2 in Ramkahen and buy the Tabard of Ramkahen. Equip it before entering original Cataclysm dungeons. Lost City of the Tol'vir is nearby and offers a repeatable Normal route; check that kills actually increase Ramkahen reputation.\n\n3. Clear reputation-granting enemies and bosses, leave the dungeon, reset it and repeat within the instance-entry limit. Keep the tabard equipped. Original Ramkahen quest rewards and unlocked daily quests can supplement the dungeon reputation.\n\n4. At Exalted, return to Abasi and buy the correct color of camel. If it was absent from his shop earlier, reopen the vendor window now. Use the reins to learn the mount; buy the other color on the same visit if needed.",
