        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - A guild with the unlock offers a direct purchase after the guild reputation grind.\n\n1. Check your guild's achievements for Guild Glory of the Cataclysm Raider (4988), including the guild runs of Blackwing Descent, The Bastion of Twilight and Throne of the Four Winds. If already complete, go straight to the reputation and purchase steps.\n\n2. If your guild wants to unlock it, form a qualifying guild raid: at least 8 guild members in 10-player mode or 20 in 25-player mode. Keep them present for the required kills and check the minimap's guild-group indicator. A solo guild member clearing the raids does not satisfy the guild-group requirement.\n\n3. Clear Blackwing Descent on the outside upper terrace of Blackrock Mountain (26.1,23.8 in Burning Steppes), The Bastion of Twilight on the high spire in Twilight Highlands (34.2,78.0), and Throne of the Four Winds above southwestern Uldum (38.4,80.6). Complete each raid's guild-run criteria and check that the guild meta has unlocked.\n\n4. Reach Exalted with that guild through eligible quests and guild activities. Alternatively, join an established guild that already has the unlock, then earn the required standing with your new guild. Personal raid credit is not required for the purchase.\n\n5. Buy Reins of the Dark Phoenix from Shay Pressler in Stormwind (67.7,73.0) or Goram in Orgrimmar (48.5,75.5), for up to 3,000 gold, and use the item. If the vendor refuses it, check both current-guild reputation and the guild achievement before repeating the raids.",
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/item=63125",
    },
