        name = "Golden King",
        mountCategory = "Achievements",
        stepCount = 4,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Join a guild, earn Exalted guild reputation and pay the gold cost.\n\n1. On an appropriate-faction character, join a guild and check your reputation with that guild. Guild levels were removed; you do not need to level a guild to 25 or complete the personal Glory of the Cataclysm Raider achievement.\n\n2. Earn guild reputation through eligible quest completions and guild activities until Exalted. If available, a guild reputation tabard helps. Check progress against your current guild rather than an old guild's standing.\n\n3. Visit Shay Pressler in Stormwind City at 67.7,73.0. Bring up to 1,500 gold, open the vendor's mount listings and buy Golden King.\n\n4. Use the reins. Check the journal on both factions before buying a second item: Golden King and Kor'kron Annihilator are paired, so one learned purchase covers their corresponding faction appearances.",
